NAME
     dz - DZ-11 communications multiplexer

DESCRIPTION
     Each line attached to the DZ-11 communications multiplexer
     behaves as described in _t_t_y(4).  Each line may be set to run
     at any of 16 speeds; see _t_t_y(4) for the encoding.

FILES
     /dev/tty#      where # is one or two digits
     /dev/ttyd[0-9a-f]

SEE ALSO
     tty(4)









































